ltyd wil bly</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou are my Heaven, and with you\nis the home where I'll always stay</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nJy is my hier en my nou</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou are my here and my now</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nWil jou vir altyd hier hou</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nWant to forever keep you right\nhere</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nJy is my rede, my lewe, jy weet</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou are my reason, my life, you\nknow</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nJy’s myne, my liefling, ek’s\njoune</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou're mine, my darling, I am\nyours &nbsp;</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nSoveel myle lê tussen ons maar\njy weet</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nSo many miles lie between us,\nbut you know</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nEk kom huistoe want ek sal jou\nnooit kan vergeet nie</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nI am coming home, I will never\nforget you</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nMy hele wêreld draai om jou\nson, jy’s die lig</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nMy whole world turns 'round\nyour sun, you're the light</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nJy’s my water, my asem, die\nwind teen my rug</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou're my water, my breath, the\nwind on my back &nbsp;</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nDaar is geen ek sonder jou</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nThere is no me without you</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nDaar’s niks waaraan ek kan hou</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nThere is nothing to which I can\nhold</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nJy is die Noorde en die woorde\nin my hart</div><div>\n\n·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\nYou are the North and